============================================================================

Contents of Archive :
---------------------

 - NewsAll                 : the program
 - NewsAll.DOK             : german manual
 - NewsAll.DOC             : english manual

============================================================================

What does it do ?
-----------------

- simply generates files for the newsflash in the same way newsall.rexx
  does, but it's x-times faster (where x is >100000......) ;-)

============================================================================

Parameter :
-----------

INFILE      : path+name of the original newsfiles without any ansis
OUTFILE     : optional parameter to create other files than News and
              News.Ansi

============================================================================

